#47000
&+yInside A Wooden Cart&N~
   The floor of this cart is made from wooden boards, the boards are worn and
dirty from use, splintering in several places. There is room to carry lots of
stuff in this cart. The side boards rise up a foot off the floor keeping the
carts load secure.
~
470 33554432 2
S
#47001
&+yInside Of A Carriage&N~
   The inside of this carriage can carry four average humans comfortably,
two on each of the two benches built on opposite sides. The sides and top
of the carriage are covered by a thick cloth, three metal ribs support the
cloth and give it shape. Flaps cut into the sides allow access in and out.
~
470 33554440 0
S
#47002
&+yInside A Large Coach&N~
   This coach interior is quite large, allowing six normal sized humans to
ride in relative comfort. There are benches on each end of the coach, with
plenty of floor space in between for legroom and a few carry-on packages.
The entire coach is built from wood will full side and roof coverage to
protect the passengers from the element or attacks. Doors have been built
into each side of the coach.
~
470 33554440 0
S
