#47006
&+yThe Bridge of the &+WWave&+BDancer&n~
&+y   This is the bridge, where the captain pilots the ship. It is built a second floor
&+yup from the main deck so he can scan the area. Though the captain grasps the wheel
&+yof the ship with vigor there also seems to be a strange contraption that is tied
&+yto wheel, buzzing and whirling, and probably would help steer the &+WWave&+BDancer&+y if some-
