&+W   The captain, known on The Ironhold Grudge as 'The Helm-Warden,'
&+cresides in a compact, hexagonal chamber located directly between
&+Wthe forward and rear ballista platforms. While smaller than the
&+csprawling passenger decks, it serves as the tactical center of
&+Wthe ferry's operations. The room serves both as a private sanc-
&+ctuary and a secondary command post for navigating the treacherous
&+Wwaters beyond Deramuth Bay. A massive, slate-topped table dominates
&+cthe center of the room, etched with permanent maps of of currents
&+Wand hidden reefs. Weighted markers are used to track The Ironhold
&+cGrudge's position, while a specialized brass tube protrudes from
&+Wthe ceiling, allowing the captain to bark orders up to his catapult
&+ccrews on the broadside decks.
~
