#47098
&+WA&+ym&+Wi&+yd&+Ws&+yt &+Wt&+yh&+We &+WR&+yi&+Wb&+ys &+yof The &+CStalval&N~
   The air here is thick with the scent of brine and ancient
&+Wmarrow, trapped within the towering, ivory arches of The Great
Whale's ribcage. These massive, sun-bleached bones curve upward
&+Wfrom the gunwales, their surfaces etched with jagged runes that
pulse with a faint, sea-blue light during high tides. The deck
&+Wplanks are made of salt-cured driftwood, smoothed by years of
barefoot use by the tribesmen. Overhead, the immense span of
&+Wthe hide-stitched sail casts a deep, shifting shadow across
the open-air heart of The Stalval.
~
