#47103
&+rT&+Rh&+Ye &+rHe&+Rar&+Yt &+ro&+Rf &+rt&+Rh&+Ye &+rWh&+Ral&+Ye&N~
&+Y   At the center of the Stalval's deck lies a massive, circular
&+Rfire-pit. The base is lined with porous volcanic stones that
&+rglow with a fierce heat. This is 'The Heart of the Whale,' a
&+Ysacred hearth where the flames never flicker out, fed by blocks
&+Rof rendered blubber and enchanted driftwood that crackle with
&+ra deep thrum. The air here is a dizzying mix of roasting meat,
&+Rpine resin, and sea salt. This is the site of meal preparation,
&+rcomfort, and ceremony.
~
