&+ydangle from the ceiling, swaying rhythmically with the heavy roll
&+Lof the sea. Massive timber beams serve as supports in the ship's
&+Lhull, groaning under the immense pressure of the waves. Patchwork
&+yhide hammocks and makeshift tents seem to crowd every nook large
&+Lenough to accomodate the seafarers who live aboard the Stalval.
