&+Lof rowing benches: slabs of petrified oak so ancient they have
&+ybeen polished to a dark, oily sheen by the constant friction
&+yof straining bodies. Deep, jagged grooves are worn into the
&+Lwood where generations of warriors have braced their feet.
&+yMassive oar-handles wrapped in rough, salt-crusted seal hide,
&+Lprotrude through reinforced ports.
~
