&+gThe Gullet&N~
&+g   The 'Gullet' is a suffocating, lightless hollow situated
&+Lat the deepest point of the Stalval's hold, where the air is
&+gthick with the stagnant stench of bilge water and rancid oil.
&+GArranged in a grim semi-circle against the slime-slick hull
&+Lare seven cramped cages, forged from salvaged, tarnished
&+gmetal. These iron enclosures, likely made to hold beasts,
&+Lare encrusted with green verdigris and deep pits of rust.
&+gThe floor here is a concave pit that collects a foul slurry
&+Gof sea-salt and grime, sloshing rhythmically against the
&+Lbase of the cages with every heavy roll of the ship.
~
