&+Y   Situated near the warmth of the central hearth, but tucked into
&+Ra recessed nook of the whale-ribs, The Rend-Slab is the ships
&+rprimary butchery and cookery. The centerpiece is a massive, waist-
&+yhigh table fashioned from a fossilized whale fluke. Its surface
&+Yis scarred by thousands of deep cleaver marks and stained a perm-
&+Ranent, dark crimson. The air is thick with a heavy, cloying scent
&+rof searing fat and the sharp spray of sea salt, as slabs of oily
&+ysalmon and hunks of translucent tentacle sizzle atop flat stones.
~
