&+Lis a terri&+Yfying weapon of war and kraken-hunting. Its mas&+Lsive
&+Lframe is&+Y constructed from the femurs of a giant and is bo&+Lund
&+Lin hea&+Yvy plates of tarnished platinum. The weapon's&+L torsion-
&+Lar&+Yms are thick bundles of braided dragon-sinew, &+Lpulled taut
&+Yby a colossal windlass that lets requires at lea&+Lst two men
&+Lto c&+Yrank. Beneath the weapon's mount, a ma&+Lssive spool of oil-
&+Lsoaked b&+Yraided rope is coiled in a heav&+Ly bronze basket, ready
