#47176
&+bA Flooded Storage Cell&N~
&+b   This cramped, lightless chamber was never intended for the living.
&+LOriginally a deep-hull larder for salt-cured meats and other cargo,
&+yit has been crudely retrofitted into a cage for The Crimson Fulgur's
&+b'more-profitable' cargo: resilient captives. A massive gate of jagged,
&+Lblack iron bars has been hammered directly into the rotting oak beams
&+yof the ceiling and floor, reinforced crudely with overlapping patchwork
&+bplates, sealing the room off from the rest of the bilge corridor.
~
