&+ymess hall is a deafening theater of Orcish gluttony and violent
&+ccamaraderie. The room is a haze of blue-grey smoke from charcoal
&+ybraziers burning at the center: an area called The Grog Pit.
&+cLong, scarred tables made of thick, iron-bound planks are arranged
&+yin a chaotic circle, their surfaces stained deep crimson from
&+cspilled wine and raw meats.
