&+GThe &+mG&+Gr&+mo&+Gg &+mPit&N~
&+G   Sunken three feet into the&+m center of the mess hall's grime-
&+Gcaked floor, the Grog Pit is &+ma circular iron-lined basin that
&+mserves as the ship's social (&+Gand violent) epicenter. It is a
&+Gliteral reservoir of 'Thunder&+m-brew', a dark, frothing mash of
&+mfermented sea-kelp and high-p&+Groof foreign spirits that have
&+mbeen claimed from surrenders,&+G or taken from raids. Orcs crowd
&+Gthe jagged rim of the pit, du&+mnking dented mugs or simply plung-
&+ming their faces into the stin&+Gging, bubbling liquid.
