#47187
&+LThe Bilge &+bB&+Lu&+bn&+Lk&+bs~
&+L   Tucked along what was likely once a livestock hold below the
&+Lmain deck, the bilge bunks are located directly above the bilge
&+bof The Crimson Fulgur, which begins just below a set of half-
&+Lsubmerged steps below here. The "beds" here are nothing more
&+bthan jagged wooden planks or strips of shark-hide lashed between
&+bthe massive ash-stained oak ribs of the ship. Pelts of various
&+Lbeasts line the beds in formless mounds, ready to accept the
&+bnext exhausted, drunk, or wounded orc.
~
