&+r   Suspended high above the bow of The Crimson Fulgur, the
&+Lrigging on the foremast is a precarious web of salt-crusted
&+Rhemp and chain. The rigging vibrates as the massive warship
&+rlurches through the undulating sea. An enormous patchwork-
&+Lstitched sail of the Storm Orcs catches full force of the
&+Rnautical winds, tilting the ship as nature pulls it across
&+rthe sea. Down below, 'The Wake-Breaker' bow of the ship
&+Lslices through the waves like a sharpened cleaver.
