&+RA Massive &+yPassenger Cabin&N~
&+R   This deep, reinforced cavernous hall has been hollowed
&+Lout to create a gargantuan passenger hold. The ceiling arches
&+Rhigh overhead, supported by thick supports of oak. Massive
&+Lmoorings of salt-rusted iron clench the creaking timbers
&+Rtogether. Heavy, low-slung benches fashioned from the
&+Lmassive masts of sunken ships are bolted into the deck
&+Rin uneven rows. The air is thick with the scent of uncured
&+Lleather, sea water, and burnt whale oil.
~
